{"id":"55089f1b579e37fc","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-signature-extension-confluence.md","title":"扩展签名保持合流性","display":"thm-signature-extension-confluence — 扩展签名保持合流性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-signature-extension-confluence","aliases":["56-thm-signature-extension-confluence"],"display":"thm-signature-extension-confluence — 扩展签名保持合流性","depends_on":["[[56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence]]","[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]"],"source_section":"§5.8 Exercise 5.8.12","source_printed_pages":"173","source_ocr_blocks":[194],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-signature-extension-confluence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-signature-extension-confluence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-signature-extension-confluence — 扩展签名保持合流性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aaaf35b38089bd17\" href=\"?note=aaaf35b38089bd17\" title=\"56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence\">56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.8 Exercise 5.8.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"173"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>194</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,a)\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,a)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma&#39;=(F&#39;,a&#39;)\">\\(\\Sigma&#39;=(F&#39;,a&#39;)\\)</span> 为签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq F&#39;\">\\(F\\subseteq F&#39;\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&#39;\\upharpoonright F=a\">\\(a&#39;\\upharpoonright F=a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F&#39;\">\\(F&#39;\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d7d212169855cb94\" href=\"?note=d7d212169855cb94\" title=\"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite\">56-df-signature-relative-rewrite</a>，不交并合流定理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aaaf35b38089bd17\" href=\"?note=aaaf35b38089bd17\" title=\"56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence\">56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma&#39;,V),\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma&#39;,V,R)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma&#39;,V),\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma&#39;,V,R)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书此项是练习，没有印出证明。这里给出本地推导：若 F′F 为空，结论是恒等实例；否则将新增符号及空规则集组成第二个系统。其一步关系为空，故合流，与原系统的不交并恰为扩展系统，由 Toyama 定理推出。该论证考虑了本目录签名必须非空的约定，不用空签名假装合法的第二分量。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence","status":"resolved","id":"aaaf35b38089bd17","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"d7d212169855cb94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-signature-relative-rewrite","status":"resolved","id":"d7d212169855cb94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,a)$、$\\Sigma'=(F',a')$ 为签名，$F\\subseteq F'$ 且 $a'\\upharpoonright F=a$；$V$ 是与 $F'$ 不交的可数无限变量集，$\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$。$\\operatorname{Red}$ 见 [[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]，不交并合流定理见 [[56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence","status":"resolved","id":"aaaf35b38089bd17","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,a)$、$\\Sigma'=(F',a')$ 为签名，$F\\subseteq F'$ 且 $a'\\upharpoonright F=a$；$V$ 是与 $F'$ 不交的可数无限变量集，$\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)$。$\\operatorname{Red}$ 见 [[56-df-signature-relative-rewrite]]，不交并合流定理见 [[56-thm-disjoint-union-confluence]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma'=(F',a')","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq F'","display":false},{"tex":"a'\\upharpoonright F=a","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"F'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V),\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma,V,R))\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{Confluent}(\\mathcal T(\\Sigma',V),\\operatorname{Red}(\\Sigma',V,R)).","display":true}],"bytes":1662